Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.51,0:00:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)游马！ 喂 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)别一直
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}窝在房间里不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多该出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！ 你听得见吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至少回句话啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)那个 明里姐游马他还没……？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 虽然不知道发生了什么{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那天开始就一直把自己关在房间里。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((游马：喂 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)谢谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！！))
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.51,0:00:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)是异晶人界哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我带到这种地方来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.31,0:00:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底想干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(唐·萨赞德)这里是我的王宫。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有统治巴利安世界的人才能进入的神圣之地。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.91,0:01:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)喂喂，难道说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.44,0:01:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了给我看这种破烂城堡……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.65,0:01:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.09,0:01:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难、难道说！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，是 No.96。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体无法吸收96。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，那家伙的力量回到了我这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么会到你那里？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.27,0:01:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是因为 No.96是我的一部分。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.83,0:01:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.55,0:01:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很久以前与星光体战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我释放的力量留在了那家伙体内。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样我就明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.61,0:01:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么在星光界里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.20,0:01:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会有像96那样的家伙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，把它拿到手。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把封印的 No.们。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是什么力量啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.31,0:02:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是封印的 No.们的力量吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有了这股力量的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在马上就能把游马打垮……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.94,0:02:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别急。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《唐·萨赞德从我体内
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.85,0:02:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失掉了》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在还不是时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们还有别的该做的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该做的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.35,0:02:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这到底是什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这个把巴利安世界和
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将人间世界融合为一。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事能做得到吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，能做到。那就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，确实这么做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或许能办到，但首先……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是力量！我啊，需要更多的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毁灭星灵世界的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}增幅人间世界的恶，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过与巴利安世界同一化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的力量将会飞跃性地增大。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.55,0:03:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，要这么做的话就必须把这东西大量生产。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.95,0:03:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，为此需要庞大的能量。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，为了这个就要用96的力量……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.34,0:03:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我暂时会专心于此。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而你，在这期间有件事要你去做。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂、喂，等一下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.13,0:04:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。我和你是同心同体。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法离开这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些 No.就授予你吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，到王座这边来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利用别人去做些见不得光的事，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是你的拿手好戏吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光，你怎么就死了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，就该像姐姐说的那样，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不去玩什么决斗就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.69,0:05:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就不会经历这么悲伤的事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((游马
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永别了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.31,0:05:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.就交给你了))
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你这么说……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我该怎么办才好我搞不懂啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.93,0:07:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打扰了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.84,0:07:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个… 这是探病的礼物。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.59,0:07:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放在那儿就行。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.27,0:07:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个啊 鲨鱼自从星光死了之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马一直很消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.79,0:07:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的我 没那个心情去聊那家伙的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐在这种艰难的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天就先这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还会再来的，璃绪小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的我又能对你说些什么呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.23,0:07:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我，我难道说……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.哈特兰德)哈——伯宁！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伟大的贝库塔大人，听闻您召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特来拜见……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太慢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝、贝库塔大人……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.05,0:08:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}您这副模样，究竟是发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.61,0:08:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}涌上来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.93,0:08:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……回、回来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变回原来的样子了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多谢您，贝库塔大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份恩情我一生都不会忘记。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.15,0:08:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你这么想，那就为了我稍微干点活吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命。请尽管吩咐！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.27,0:08:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这家伙 从九十九游马那里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.70,0:08:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把 No.卡夺过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡１。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:09:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为 为了我竟然拿出这么珍贵的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 作为部下 这些家伙也
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一并派给你吧 好好看着。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.95,0:09:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你们是……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.11,0:09:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(蝉丸)呵呵呵 曾经在暗决斗界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.49,0:09:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被称为四恶人的我们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然又像这样要再次联手了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝉丸…… 哼。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔大人 我们必定不负您的期望。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我做了好多炸鸡块
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 多吃点哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.91,0:09:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小霞)比起小鸟的炸鸡什么的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的特制猫饭请享用吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)锵～。这次我做了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.23,0:09:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Number's俱乐部的徽章哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然大家的分也有哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)比起那种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用这个秘技
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}入手的稀有卡牌全都给你们啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)我也来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.43,0:10:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特别发行的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.48,0:10:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}教室打扫免除券
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.89,0:10:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赠送给大家哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.19,0:10:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天之岩户作战
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失败了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体不见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.99,0:10:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也难怪。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下 彻底完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.09,0:11:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你输了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.17,0:11:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照约定你的记忆我就收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.21,0:11:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)决斗者连续失忆事件吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在深夜的路上被发现时处于昏迷状态。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.19,0:11:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即使恢复意识，受害者们也都
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.65,0:11:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了所有的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是谁干的……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.28,0:11:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)是吗，果然星光界的消失是真的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.75,0:11:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来异晶界的攻击会更加猛烈啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来该我们出动的时候了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马就拜托你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})拉杰尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)决斗者连续失忆事件吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)背后一定有异晶界在搞鬼汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.29,0:12:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.31,0:12:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Numbers俱乐部终于又轮到出场了呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。 要是知道我们在努力的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 说不定能稍微打起精神来。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.64,0:12:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让游马重新振作起来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.95,0:12:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个事件！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)就由我们来解决吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.81,0:12:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)哦——！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.71,0:12:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 蝉丸！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么怎么回事 你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么叫什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.53,0:12:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的使命是从九十九游马那里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可你 却每晚都跑出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}净袭击些无关的决斗者。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.22,0:12:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊 别那么急躁嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.93,0:12:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只是正式上场前的热身啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且对我来说 那些家伙的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.51,0:12:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像饭一样的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人的记忆是蜜的味道。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着它被吸干，变成空壳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}实在让人受不了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀！？这家伙是九十九游马的那个附赠小丫头！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，拿来当零食倒是挺不错的小鬼们啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.95,0:13:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗者连续记忆丧失事件的有好几起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是在这个心之地纪念馆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}附近发生的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.59,0:13:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)那这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定犯人就藏在这背后的意思吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.67,0:13:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是找到了，就用这个铁板面包
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.63,0:13:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把他拍成铁板烧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.57,0:13:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(蝉丸)喂喂那家伙是反过来的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.27,0:14:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈——啊 燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之地！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好久不见了 九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 还活着吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了你们我虽然被丢进了异世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.19,0:14:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但在贝库塔大人的力量下复活了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些家伙 你当然认识吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.51,0:14:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心之地)看来 这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会插手这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像是为了鼓励你。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大概他们是觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要把事件解决给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.63,0:14:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就会高兴吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带着 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在立刻到心园纪念馆来。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.15,0:14:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 等着我啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.61,0:14:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.78,0:15:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你终于来了 九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园… 小鸟她们在哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在那边。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫… 喂 铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你… 你这家伙… 对大家做了什么！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我把他们的记忆吸走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.03,0:15:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在那里的那些小鬼们的记忆 全部!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么!? 你是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.33,0:15:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是 蝉丸。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要回他们的记忆的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.35,0:15:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就拿 No.来跟我决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽说如此 其实结果 早就已经注定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.09,0:15:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被夺走 No. 也救不了同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.93,0:15:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能狼狈地哭喊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就这样败下阵去。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《 赌上 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与同伴记忆的决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不容许失败的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对只能赢的决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.30,0:15:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今 你在怕什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:16:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直以来我不都是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.66,0:16:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《阿斯特拉尔…》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.49,0:16:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了 等等 蝉丸。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没必要那样把人逼到绝境。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你好好想想。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 围绕 No.的争斗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是巴利安世界与阿斯特拉尔世界的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟身为人类的你本没有关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.97,0:16:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 在阿斯特拉尔消失的现在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你来说，守护Numbers的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经不存在了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可是好心才这么说的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要你把Numbers交出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今后我们就不会对你们出手，我保证。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然，也会把同伴的记忆还给你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.71,0:16:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干脆把你心中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}关于Astra的记忆只把那部分抹去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:17:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是谁，痛苦的记忆总是想要忘掉的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}悲伤的回忆之类的没有才好，这是肯定的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西，全部消除掉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就能回到与Astra相遇之前的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个安稳又和平的世界了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.23,0:17:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与Astra相遇之前……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我做不到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.37,0:17:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么星光界啊什么异晶界啊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事确实跟我没关系！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.93,0:17:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 No.们是星光
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.35,0:17:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托付给我的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.里面，有我和星光的……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有我们共同度过的一起战斗过来的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切全都装在里面！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种东西，怎么可能交给你们这帮家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})说得没错，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的决心，我确实听到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果为了该守护的东西有战斗的意志的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我愿成为你的剑成为守护你身躯的盾。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.09,0:18:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那之后 我们以哥哥们为中心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.99,0:18:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对巴利安世界与星光世界展开了研究。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这过程中 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你失去了星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 你是我第一个朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.83,0:18:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的这份悲伤我怎么可能置之不理！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区矮子爸爸的3个笨蛋儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.99,0:18:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能做什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把搞笑眼镜的苍蝇碾死这种事 我还是做得到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}长着张可爱的脸 却这么嘴硬…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么还能使用纹章的力量！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了哥哥大人开发的这个手环啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里面有父亲大人分给我的纹章之力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用科学的力量封印住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}分给我的力量……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……虽然我没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.21,0:19:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}代替星光体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.09,0:19:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但和那些家伙的决斗，我也来助你一臂之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.41,0:19:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然曾经的我是和你拼上性命战斗过的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但现在作为同伴一起齐心协力战斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为同伴，齐心协力……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.77,0:19:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.61,0:19:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.们就拜托你了))
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.53,0:19:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体他 把 No.们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你把星光界 No.托付给我的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.49,0:19:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定是想让我正确使用这份力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.89,0:20:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我要把这份力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.44,0:20:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和同伴分享 一起战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.05,0:20:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.61,0:20:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是不是正确答案我不知道{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.31,0:20:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但这就是 我现在的答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.94,0:20:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你终于
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.22,0:20:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算用决斗来做个了断了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊！ 那就来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.82,0:20:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无所谓。你们两个一起上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.51,0:20:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份从容 你会后悔的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.35,0:20:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.75,0:20:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:20:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（3人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.09,0:21:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝉丸！在你风光登场的舞台上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.65,0:21:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我来给你添上一朵花吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.59,0:21:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的眷属啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将恶之纹章刻于大地之上。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么啊？这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个空间里，决斗开始的同时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝉丸可以将你们一半的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}据为己有。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.67,0:21:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太卑鄙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，确实卑鄙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，那又有什么问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}雕像……坏掉了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:21:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那才是那家伙的……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）真正的姿态……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.45,0:23:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.37,0:23:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
